          "Content": "<div><span>Custom error pages are now generally available on App Service. When using custom error pages you can configure your apps to present an error page of your choosing instead of the default error pages that are presented to your users.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/app-service/configure-error-pages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Learn more</span></a><span>.&nbsp;</span></div>",
